### UELS API test requests
### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code (humao.rest-client), then click "Send Request" above any request.
### Cookies (login session) are kept automatically between requests.

@base = http://localhost/uels-backend/api

### 0. Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. First-time setup: create the first administrator (works only once)
POST {{base}}/setup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_number": "ADMIN-001",
  "first_name": "System",
  "last_name": "Admin",
  "email": "admin@university.edu",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin@university.edu",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### 4. Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard

### 5. Create a lending staff account (admin only)
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_number": "STAFF-001",
  "first_name": "Lena",
  "last_name": "Librarian",
  "email": "staff@university.edu",
  "password": "Staff12345!",
  "role": "staff",
  "department": "Library"
}

### 6. Register a student (public self-registration)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_number": "2024-00001",
  "first_name": "Juan",
  "last_name": "Dela Cruz",
  "email": "juan@university.edu",
  "password": "Student123!",
  "role": "student",
  "department": "BSIT"
}

### 7. Search the equipment list
GET {{base}}/equipment?q=power&available_only=1

### 8. Add equipment (admin)
POST {{base}}/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asset_tag": "CMP-100",
  "name": "Webcam 1080p",
  "category_id": 1,
  "total_quantity": 5,
  "condition_status": "excellent",
  "location": "Equipment Room"
}

### 9. Borrower requests equipment (log in as the student first)
POST {{base}}/loans/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipment_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "due_date": "2026-11-05",
  "purpose": "Thesis defense"
}

### 10. Staff: list pending requests
GET {{base}}/loans?status=pending

### 11. Staff: approve & issue (replace 1 with the loan id)
POST {{base}}/loans/1/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{ "condition_before": "good" }

### 12. Staff: walk-in borrowing
POST {{base}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrower_id": 2,
  "equipment_id": 4,
  "quantity": 1,
  "due_date": "2026-11-04",
  "purpose": "Class presentation"
}

### 13. Staff: receive a return
POST {{base}}/loans/1/return
Content-Type: application/json

{ "condition_after": "good", "remarks": "Returned complete" }

### 14. Overdue items
GET {{base}}/loans/overdue

### 15. Reports (add &format=csv to download a CSV)
GET {{base}}/reports/inventory
###
GET {{base}}/reports/borrowing?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
###
GET {{base}}/reports/overdue?format=csv

### 16. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
